type: software
title: "BMicro (fork)"
abstract: >-
  Graphical program for the evaluation of Brillouin microscopy data (requires the matching fork of bmlab, 0.14.0). Modified fork of BMicro by the BMicro developers, released under the GNU General Public License v3.0. The
  modifications by Niklas Gampl are documented in the CHANGELOG and the commit history.
